# ─── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Anything that could hold a real key. Broad on purpose: the cost of an
# over-ignored file is a moment's confusion; the cost of an under-ignored one
# is a live CDP wallet secret in a public repository, permanently, because
# git history keeps it even after you delete the file.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json

# ─── Dependencies and build output ──────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ─── Working files, not deliverables ────────────────────────────────────
# Scratch output from assistant sessions: duplicated docs, screenshots of a
# development environment mid-error. Useful while building, misleading in a
# public repository.
Claude outputs/
brand/

# Numbered duplicates. The desktop bridge writes "name-1.png" rather than
# overwriting, so these appear without anyone asking for them.
*-1.png
*-2.png

# ─── Tooling and OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.vercel
coverage/
.turbo/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
*.swp

# ─── Local-only ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI coding-assistant instructions. `next dev` rewrites AGENTS.md on its own,
# so it is ignored rather than deleted.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
# Launch-video source (Remotion). Kept on this machine, not published.
video/
